cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StructBench, please cite it as below."
title: StructBench
abstract: >-
  Standardized benchmarks for machine learning on structural simulation:
  a task definition, a fixed split, a relative-L2 headline metric with
  physical-unit errors reported alongside, and a reference baseline to
  beat — for structures under dynamic and extreme loading.
